                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.4061 Motion Pictures/7–1345: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hurley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-17T19:00:00-04:00">July 17, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1111. Hays Office appreciates your efforts (Your 1161, July 13) and authorizes
                    proposal.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
